        "id": 2133961668,
        "content": "Resolves #90\r\nCurrently working offline by caching issues. When we load we get issues from cache and start trying to fetch from json. If it's successful we check if there are new issues, if so we cache them and re-display issues.\r\nNo network demo:\r\n[noNetwork.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8099ce8e-dca7-4df9-8ec2-d13f9a3e4578)\r\nCached issues are in sync:\r\n[alreadyCached.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a024da43-5732-4225-850f-d9069d3c5893)\r\nCached issues not in sync:\r\n[fetchAndCache.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38493c07-15cb-4098-b6db-8cb88ceeaa23)",
